cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: ""
authors:
  - family-names: "Sagnelli"
    given-names: "Domenico"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0000-0000-0000"   # <- replace with your real ORCID
abstract: >-
  MOSAN is an autonomous AI-agent framework that designs, trains and evaluates
  neural architectures across data modalities (1-D spectra, time series and 2-D
  images), guided by an Organic Strategic Graph Memory (OSGM) and a multi-agent
  Theorist/Critic/Decider loop.
keywords:
  - autonomous agents
  - neural architecture search
  - AutoML
  - domain adaptation
